@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowColor #334155
skinparam BorderColor #334155
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF8DC
skinparam NoteBorderColor #B6A16C
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 300
title UC-06  Administrator responsibilities
' Requirements: PERM-01 PERM-02 PERM-03 PERM-04 PERM-05 ACC-04 ACC-06 ACC-07 ACC-08 ACC-09 ACC-10 ACC-11 ACC-12 ACC-13 ACC-14 ACC-15 ACC-16 ACC-17 ACC-18 ACC-19 ACC-20 REPORT-03 NOTICE-01 NOTICE-02 DATA-01 P-01 P-08
left to right direction
actor "Administrator" as A
rectangle "CS-GAMUERS: account administration" {
  usecase "Approve student and\nfaculty applications" as U0
  usecase "Invite Administrators\nand Program Heads" as U1
  usecase "Correct verified identity details" as U2
  usecase "Assist recovery and reopen\na rejected application" as U3
  usecase "Change another staff member role" as U4
  usecase "Deactivate or reactivate accounts" as U5
  usecase "Read administrative activity history" as U6
}
A -- U0
A -- U1
A -- U2
A -- U3
A -- U4
A -- U5
A -- U6
note bottom of A
Reasons and notifications apply as specified in PRD.
Transfer owned content before removing Faculty access.
Cannot change own role or deactivate self.
Cannot remove the last active Administrator.
Role changes: Faculty, Program Head, Administrator only.
No learning-score edits, private chat, or publication.
end note
footer CS-GAMUERS | UC-06 | Product behavior
@enduml
